  "release_notes": "\u2022 Farm category tabs now show complete Crop Field, Herb Field, and Tree Field labels in a horizontally scrollable row with larger buttons, preventing clipped text.\n\u2022 Herb and Tree field selectors choose an available seed, the field tabs fit smaller screens, and Herb seeds are sold by the Market Trader.\n\u2022 Farm workers check crops every 250 ms and harvest as soon as they are ready.\n\u2022 Cultivation adds 10% Attack and Max Health per breakthrough, up to +1,000% at Immortal Ascension Realm Stage X, and preserves the current health percentage.\n\u2022 Cleaned stray edge pixels from the Shadowveil weather icon.",
